OL,3,GNEWSARailway trespass incidents on the
OL,4,Arise in Sussex
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew figures from Network Rail have
OL,7,Frevealed that trespass on the railway
OL,8,Fhas risen in Sussex over the last 12
OL,9,Fmonths - and in recent years.
OL,11,FThere were 951 trespass incidents
OL,12,Facross the county's railway network in
OL,13,F2025/26, over 70 more than the number
OL,14,Frecorded during 2024/25, and
OL,15,Fsignificantly higher than the 715 in
OL,16,F2021/22.
OL,18,FLast week, staff and police joined
OL,19,Fforces at Clapham Junction station for
OL,20,Fan action day to tackle trespassing and
OL,21,Fanti-social behaviour, and help protect
OL,22,Fvulnerable people.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
