OL,3,GNEWSARailway trespass incidents on the
OL,4,Arise in Sussex
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaul Langley, from Network Rail, said
OL,7,Fthe provider was working with British
OL,8,FTransport Police to "take practical,
OL,9,Ftargeted action" against trespassing,
OL,10,Fsuch as using drones.
